WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:07.880
Hey there. I'd like to think you're in the
right place. And now that you're here, let

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:12.900
me tell you why this place matters to me.
I'm Terrence Lee. When I began exploring

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.700
AI, I had questions.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:19.960
There were things I didn't understand and
moments when I wasn't sure how to move

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:25.060
forward. As I worked through that
uncertainty, I started thinking about how

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:29.920
many other people might be having a
similar experience. People who wanted to

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.740
learn, who could see possibilities,

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:37.380
but needed somewhere to begin that made
sense to them. I understood that person

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:42.080
because I had been in that position
myself. That experience became part of the

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:47.080
reason we created the AI Confidence
Academy. Behind every question someone

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:52.100
types into an AI tool is a human being.
Someone trying to understand

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:56.440
something, accomplish something or find a
better way forward.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:01:02.040
I wanted us to keep that person in mind
throughout everything we built. I wanted

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:06.380
everyday people to find an academy they
could see themselves in. Somewhere they

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:11.100
could say, this was put together with
someone like me in mind That intention

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:16.280
shaped ACA and it matters to me
personally. Our presenters will give you a

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:21.740
closer look at what we've created and how
the Academy approaches learning, but first

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:27.180
thank you for finding us. I'm glad our
paths have crossed and I look forward to

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:31.920
sharing this experience with you. Come
journey with us. Let's show you what we

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:32.320
built.

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:38.480
Welcome to the AI Confidence Academy.
We're glad you stopped by. Perhaps

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:42.540
someone introduced you to us. Perhaps
you've been hearing about artificial

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:47.640
intelligence and wondering what it could
mean for your work, your business or your

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:48.480
everyday life.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:53.960
You may have tried AI already. You may
still be deciding where to begin.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:59.400
The Academy gives you a place to learn
with clear instruction, practical

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.740
experience, and room to develop your own
understanding.

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:05.860
At the heart of our Academy is a belief.

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:07.720
People come first.

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:11.640
AI is the tool. Confidence is the product.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:16.120
The AI Confidence Academy was established
by co-founders Terrence Lee and Jeff

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:20.260
Wilson around a straightforward purpose,
helping people become more confident and

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:21.640
capable in their use of AI.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:27.160
The Academy welcomes everyone. In phase
one, we give particular attention to

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:32.580
adults in their 40s, 50s, 60s, and beyond
who are entering the AI space. You may be

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:36.620
transitioning in your career, exploring a
business opportunity, or learning how

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:41.300
these tools can fit into the next part of
your life. You bring experience, skills,

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:46.140
and judgment that matter. We build on that
foundation. We don't teach tools.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:52.240
We train humans. Our focus is on your
ability to understand, participate, make

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:57.120
decisions, and use AI with confidence. You
don't need a technical background to begin

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:00.900
our introductory course. You need a
willingness to practice and examine what

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:04.480
you're learning. We teach principles that
outlast platforms.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.500
Applications will change.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.370
Features will change.

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:14.000
The ability to ask a clear question, give
useful instructions, evaluate an answer,

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:19.360
and make a sound decision remains
valuable. Here, you practice using AI to

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:24.500
organize information, explore ideas,
improve communication, and work through

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:29.580
everyday tasks. You learn through video,
audio, written guidance, and activities

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:34.560
you complete yourself. Our lessons are
organized into journeys, so each lesson

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:38.900
gives you something to carry into the
next. we also teach you to protect private

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:39.540
information,

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:44.180
check important claims, and recognize the
limits of an AI response.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.140
Our principle is simple,

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:52.160
AI assists, humans verify. We don't
promise instant expertise, guaranteed

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:57.540
income, or a tool that can make every
decision for you. AI can produce an answer

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:01.420
that sounds convincing and still gets
something wrong. Learning to recognize

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:06.320
that is part of becoming capable. We
encourage you to remain resourceful. Ask

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:11.740
questions and bring your own judgment to
the work. Dependency says, AI, think

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:16.960
for me. Confidence says, AI, think with
me. That distinction guides

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:21.380
how we teach. Your understanding and your
ability to act remains central.

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:26.160
Confidence grows when you can do something
you couldn't do before and understand how

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:31.240
you did it. It might begin with a clearer
message, a useful plan, or a question that

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:34.920
helps you see a problem differently.
Through practice, you learn which

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:38.940
approaches work, what needs correction,
and when your own judgment must lead.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:44.520
For someone entering the space in their
40s, 50s, 60s, or later, that progress can

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:45.500
open possibilities.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.500
You can draw on what you already know
while developing skills for what comes

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:53.140
next. These are capabilities you can
continue building as the technology

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:57.940
changes. Take a look around the website,
explore the course information,

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:02.740
see how the learning is structured, and
consider what you would like to become

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:07.600
more capable of doing. Whether you are
beginning something new or bringing AI

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:09.460
into work you already understand,

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:13.300
the Academy offers a guided place to
develop that capability.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:18.200
When you're ready, visit the enrollment
page to review the details and decide

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:22.700
whether the Academy is right for you. We
would be pleased to have you join us.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:25.700
Welcome to the AI Confidence Academy.

